                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9d702ff9-7bde-333e-9f4d-2339ca30df3f",
                        "entry_id": "4917e433-e71e-324b-a963-34b91de83afd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "als dit niet het geval zou zijn"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d736f859-066d-4bcf-8e11-4069c2b74bd5",
                                "sense_id": "9d702ff9-7bde-333e-9f4d-2339ca30df3f",
                                "text": "Het is wijs, zij het deprimerend, om een lijst van tweede keuzes bij je te hebben, zoniet om rekening te houden met de mogelijkheid van een krankzinnige koopimpuls, wanneer je, dol van frustratie, de dichtstbijzijnde en minst bij je tuin passende plant op je winkelwagen laadt."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d5dc9bce-36a3-3554-b7c7-7a49ad6dea2e",
                        "entry_id": "4917e433-e71e-324b-a963-34b91de83afd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "sterker nog"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "eigenlijk een ontkenning die juist als versterking gebruikt wordt"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9634bb9c-4453-454e-8fff-333eb925b8a5",
                                "sense_id": "d5dc9bce-36a3-3554-b7c7-7a49ad6dea2e",
                                "text": "\"Ik maak de beste kiwisap van Europa, zoniet de hele wereld.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4936bd0f-3a99-4be6-a12a-e16668d91647",
                        "source_entry_id": "4917e433-e71e-324b-a963-34b91de83afd",
                        "source_sense_id": "9d702ff9-7bde-333e-9f4d-2339ca30df3f",
                        "source_sense_description": "als dit niet het geval zou zijn",
                        "target_lang_word": "sonst",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sonst",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "05d64c88-513b-3e29-b6c2-5a8d2a7fbf79",
                                        "entry_id": "7e126981-79fa-3571-a80c-9ac466dbafed",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "für gewöhnlich, im allgemeinen, bei anderen Gelegenheiten, zu anderer Zeit als gerade jetzt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f8db1b4a-d195-45e0-81fa-13161680abc3",
                                                "sense_id": "05d64c88-513b-3e29-b6c2-5a8d2a7fbf79",
                                                "text": "Was machst du sonst so dieses Wochenende?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2143c4c9-33a6-4e59-863c-0151345bd167",
                                                "sense_id": "05d64c88-513b-3e29-b6c2-5a8d2a7fbf79",
                                                "text": "Und wie gehts sonst?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7214bdda-5154-4012-80d2-49006fc37d3a",
                                                "sense_id": "05d64c88-513b-3e29-b6c2-5a8d2a7fbf79",
                                                "text": "Das hier ist eine Ausnahme, sonst schlafe ich nicht bis 11 Uhr morgens."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de8c9620-51f3-4166-93ec-30b13774638c",
                                                "sense_id": "05d64c88-513b-3e29-b6c2-5a8d2a7fbf79",
                                                "text": "Sonst trinke ich eigentlich immer Tee, aber heute mache ich gerne eine Ausnahme."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f9fea507-aa1b-4afe-91d9-61705945ba6e",
                                                "sense_id": "05d64c88-513b-3e29-b6c2-5a8d2a7fbf79",
                                                "text": "„Man kann beispielsweise Pflanzen mittels Gentechnik so manipulieren, dass sie gegen bestimmte Krankheiten immun oder unempfindlich gegen sonst giftige chemische Pflanzenschutzmittel werden.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "723c16eb-db22-37df-bd28-c7340afa3c8c",
                                        "entry_id": "7e126981-79fa-3571-a80c-9ac466dbafed",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "darüber hinaus, extra"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a17e722f-2e1f-44e6-b677-e2bd17ddadf2",
                                                "sense_id": "723c16eb-db22-37df-bd28-c7340afa3c8c",
                                                "text": "Gibt es sonst keine Experten auf diesem Gebiet?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c9f5e9a6-c221-4143-95ec-a526184dbc06",
                                                "sense_id": "723c16eb-db22-37df-bd28-c7340afa3c8c",
                                                "text": "Möchten Sie sonst noch etwas?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "04907b3a-5af2-4044-ac3b-3afd4f1b11bf",
                                                "sense_id": "723c16eb-db22-37df-bd28-c7340afa3c8c",
                                                "text": "Und sonst hast du keine Sorgen?"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9f44b10f-b38d-33e9-ac3b-7913c24c8e11",
                                        "entry_id": "7e126981-79fa-3571-a80c-9ac466dbafed",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "im anderen Fall"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Konjunktion"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0c3e9c5a-da38-488e-8b66-2c8835b366dd",
                                                "sense_id": "9f44b10f-b38d-33e9-ac3b-7913c24c8e11",
                                                "text": "Ich schließe immer meine Tür ab, sonst könnte ja jeder einfach so hineinkommen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5147eed7-e242-4c05-843b-08dcd025bfcb",
                                                "sense_id": "9f44b10f-b38d-33e9-ac3b-7913c24c8e11",
                                                "text": "Ich muss jetzt schlafen, sonst bin ich morgen zu nichts zu gebrauchen."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4e5c96b9-b099-4a04-bda5-a39c0959aec7",
                        "source_entry_id": "4917e433-e71e-324b-a963-34b91de83afd",
                        "source_sense_id": "9d702ff9-7bde-333e-9f4d-2339ca30df3f",
                        "source_sense_description": "als dit niet het geval zou zijn",
                        "target_lang_word": "else",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "else",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c5b53403-a10a-3d88-9162-dd0dc250117c",
                                        "entry_id": "f70f0d05-1ace-36b4-bee0-fb92a8e4cffe",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Other; in addition to previously mentioned items."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable",
                                            "postpositional"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff6d6ca2-03f6-4644-9ded-5495f42b305e",
                                                "sense_id": "c5b53403-a10a-3d88-9162-dd0dc250117c",
                                                "text": "The instructor is busy. Can anyone else help me?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "957380c8-d996-4537-a4fc-8263cfc26eb2",
                                                "sense_id": "c5b53403-a10a-3d88-9162-dd0dc250117c",
                                                "text": "Whatever else she may be, she is not a surgeon."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c9c05d92-20b9-4176-8654-c761f45408ab",
                                                "sense_id": "c5b53403-a10a-3d88-9162-dd0dc250117c",
                                                "text": "When all else fails, read the instructions."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "37d254c6-25dc-4294-9860-94f8e22f1474",
                                                "sense_id": "c5b53403-a10a-3d88-9162-dd0dc250117c",
                                                "text": "Prospero:\nThou hast done well, fine Ariel. Follow me;\nHark what thou else shalt do me."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c1997bc3-bdb1-43cb-9cf7-9b602f78d57a",
                                                "sense_id": "c5b53403-a10a-3d88-9162-dd0dc250117c",
                                                "text": "As with most else in society, early Americans believed that health and healing were in God's hand."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "else",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c8a68525-2c50-399f-be93-4aaf0bf88b24",
                                        "entry_id": "e89129da-46d1-3613-abc4-c72f6effbf08",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Otherwise, if not."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "28759b2e-2826-48b3-a10d-b4168d029e08",
                                                "sense_id": "c8a68525-2c50-399f-be93-4aaf0bf88b24",
                                                "text": "How else (= in what other way) can it be done?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "29e58eff-a62a-455a-9b9e-ce27a4243134",
                                                "sense_id": "c8a68525-2c50-399f-be93-4aaf0bf88b24",
                                                "text": "I'm busy Friday; when else (= what other time) works for you?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "491370e0-4374-4ca5-a033-1c08c60d9825",
                                                "sense_id": "c8a68525-2c50-399f-be93-4aaf0bf88b24",
                                                "text": "The crust of ice on the else rippling brook was so transparent, and so thin in texture, that the lively water might of its own free will have stopped—in Tom’s glad mind it had—to look upon the lovely morning."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "else",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "83e336f1-fe86-3022-9b7e-c04111be70ad",
                                        "entry_id": "c24ef87f-0837-33de-a551-905117fc0dba",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "For otherwise; or else."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0637656f-3e3d-4900-8da0-570ef416973b",
                                                "sense_id": "83e336f1-fe86-3022-9b7e-c04111be70ad",
                                                "text": "Then the Wronskian of f and g must be nonzero, else they could not be linearly independent."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0ad49d22-acdd-4751-8250-dfdcd2eff7eb",
                                                "sense_id": "83e336f1-fe86-3022-9b7e-c04111be70ad",
                                                "text": "He had never seen dogs fight as these wolfish creatures fought, and his first experience taught him an unforgetable lesson. It is true, it was a vicarious experience, else he would not have lived to profit by it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ffce902e-9e9d-4005-9e19-da6891824db7",
                        "source_entry_id": "4917e433-e71e-324b-a963-34b91de83afd",
                        "source_sense_id": "9d702ff9-7bde-333e-9f4d-2339ca30df3f",
                        "source_sense_description": "als dit niet het geval zou zijn",
                        "target_lang_word": "sinon",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sinon",
